#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_7
msgid ""
"\"I don't just sell coffee,\" Marcus says with a smile.<br>I provide a reason for people to slow down, look up \n"
"from their phones, and say good morning to their neighbors."
msgstr ""
"\"No solo vendo café\", dice Marcus con una sonrisa.<br>Le doy un motivo a "
"las personas para que se den un respiro, dejen de mirar\n"
"sus teléfonos y le den los buenos días a sus vecinos."

